WHO   — The Great Operation — imagination, surgically removed
WHAT  — The State's final cure for the soul: not punishment but the deletion of the capacity to dissent.
WHERE — WE1 · WE  Framework inputs: We (Yevgeny Zamyatin, 1924)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
